{
  "name": "Kit: travel agent (example)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "65905ba7-4a46-5695-bc0c-14d58b2ce830",
      "name": "Case in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "kit-travel-agent",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "travel-agent",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Each case comes in here",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "5ea930d0-01d3-5b55-9603-bb1122808f1e",
      "name": "Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "text": "={{PROMPT:agent.input}}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "={{PROMPT:agent}}",
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
      "notes": "AI: picks the tools",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "838e2f0b-c6c0-5e7a-b19b-52e3aff86d69",
      "name": "OpenAI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        208,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "{{KIT_MODEL}}"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": false,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 100000,
          "maxRetries": 1
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "{{OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID}}",
          "name": "Kit OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c8c2db-ec9b-5713-b09d-9a6dfb48c470",
      "name": "Kit tools (MCP)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClientTool",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        384,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "endpointUrl": "{{KIT_TOOLS_URL}}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3d8d57e7-0b86-56da-85b8-ada677d91cfd",
      "name": "Result shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        560,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Case in').item.json.body.output_schema) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ece90a56-9baf-5482-9984-df20e9f5d143",
      "name": "Result out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.output) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Sends it to the kit",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "0e721124-1721-556e-9aad-bd331b7f24a7",
      "name": "Note: in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 940,
        "content": "## 1 Case in\nThe kit sends one test case here: `{case_id, today, input, output_schema}`.\n\n**See the data of one eval case:** kit results → the case → **n8n execution ↗** → double-click a node."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ba12aa0-4b15-503c-a3ed-213762b51ee8",
      "name": "Note: agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 940,
        "content": "## 2 Agent\n**This is an agent: the model picks the tools.** Compare it with the workflow `Kit: travel workflow`, where code picks the path.\nThe job and the steps are in the **system message** (Agent > Options). It has **no send tool**.\nRun it: engine `n8n-agent` on the Run page."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2506b324-60a9-512c-b720-3e3dcf8677a2",
      "name": "Note: out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        704,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 940,
        "content": "## 3 Result out\n**Result shape** forces the JSON into the schema.\nIt reads the schema from the case (`body.output_schema`, sent by the runner from `output.schema.json`), so a schema change needs no edit here."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Case in": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Agent",
